{"seq":2,"at":"2026-10-20","kind":"edited","target":{"type":"article","id":"a0880"},"reason":"Rewritten by the merge to take in the printed cards' questions.","by":"merge film-media/film","ref":"quiz-archive/runs/tp-ingest/decisions/film-media__film.g5.json","changes":[{"field":"bodyEn","diff":[["=",284],["+","Ten years later Attenborough turned to a very different life. Chaplin (1992), with Robert Downey Jr. in the title role, follows Charlie Chaplin from the London music halls to Hollywood fame and exile in Switzerland. Its most touching piece of casting was Chaplin's own daughter Geraldine, who played Hannah Chaplin, Charlie's mother (her own grandmother), the music-hall singer whose breakdown left her young sons to fend for themselves. Downey received an Oscar nomination for Best Actor.\n\n"],["=",574],["+","tramp in a bowler hat, a "],["=",79]]},{"field":"bodyDe","diff":[["=",286],["+","Zehn Jahre später wandte sich Attenborough einem ganz anderen Leben zu. „Chaplin“ (1992) mit Robert Downey Jr. in der Titelrolle folgt Charlie Chaplin von den Londoner Varietébühnen zum Ruhm in Hollywood und ins Schweizer Exil. Die berührendste Besetzung war Chaplins eigene Tochter Geraldine; sie spielte Hannah Chaplin, Charlies Mutter (ihre eigene Großmutter), jene Varietésängerin, deren Zusammenbruch ihre kleinen Söhne sich selbst überließ. Downey wurde für den Oscar als bester Hauptdarsteller nominiert.\n\n"],["=",558],["+","Tramp mit Melone, einen "],["=",71]]}]},
